{# PANEL: NOTORIETATE WIKIPEDIA (wide) #}
<div class="panel wide">
  <div class="panel-header">
    <span class="panel-label">Notorietate Wikipedia · vizualizări lunare medii · ro.wikipedia.org · 12 luni</span>
  </div>
